    "title": "Naväge Starter Bundle: Nose Cleaner and 30 SaltPod Capsules",
    "body_html": "<p>Designed with your nose in mind. Naväge helps relieve nasal congestion and stuffiness by washing and moisturizing the nasal cavity with a pressure-controlled stream of saline. <span data-teams=\"true\"><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak\">With one-touch, Naväge uses powered suction to flush out mucus and germs, the device does the work to send you on your way to a better day</span></span>. Bundle includes: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Naväge Nose Cleaner</li>\n<li>30 SaltPods</li>\n<li>One pair of Standard Nose Pillows</li>\n<li>Two preinstalled AA batteries</li>\n</ul>",
